  "raw": {
    "https://dos.mst.edu": {
      "title": "Missouri S&TMissouri S&T",
      "description": "dos.mst.edu – Dean of Students  |\n Missouri S&T Skip to content Give News Events Directory Map Select Language ​ ▼ Missouri S&T Missouri S&T Apply Visit Get Info Future Students Current Students Alumni Faculty and Staff All of Missouri S&T Just this site Explore S&T Apply Visit Get Info Future Students Current Students Alumni Faculty and Staff All of Missouri S&T Just this site Give News Events Directory Map dos.mst.edu Dean of Students 300 W 13th St, 106 Parker Hall, Rolla MO 65409 (573) 341-4209 dos@mst.edu Dean of Students Office dos@mst.edu (573) 341-4209 300 W 13th St, 106 Parker Hall, Rolla MO 65409 Home Services Student Absence Notification Conduct History Request Student Complaints and Grievances Parental Notification Module Community Standards Policies and Procedures Student Conduct Process Reporting Academic Integrity Frequently Asked Questions Hazing Definitions Policy Statement Reporting Investigation Prevention Resources Resources Students Family Faculty and Staff Meet the Team Main Content Transforming Tomorrow: The Miner Experience The Dean of Students Office cultivates a transformative Miner experience by creating engaging living and learning environments, fostering meaningful connections, and developing career-ready graduates who uphold our community values. We empower students through holistic support services, innovative programming, and strategic partnerships that cultivate their personal, academic, and professional growth. Together with students, we build an inclusive community where every Miner can thrive and make a positive influence at S&T and beyond. Seeking support? Not sure where to turn? Navigating the college experience can be complex. View our page of resources to help you find your way. Find Support Absence Notification Process Course attendance and participation are essential to student success. As a service to students, the Dean of Students Office may provide notice to faculty for absences of three or more consecutive days that meet the defined extenuating circumstance categories. Explore Community Standards Community Standards Standards and policies for individual or organizational accountability that help to foster a safe and successful campus community. Explore Family and Friends We Are Here to Help - Supporting your student throughout college can be challenging. There are many changes occurring for both of you, but we are here to help! Your role as a parent, mentor, and support system is important to your student’s success. Learn More Contact Us Dean of Students Office 300 W 13th St. 106 Parker Hall, Rolla MO 65409 Phone: (573) 341-4209 Email: dos@mst.edu Operating Hours Monday: 8:00 am - 4:30 pm Tuesday: 8:00 am - 4:30 pm Wednesday: 8:00 am - 4:30 pm Thursday: 8:00 am - 4:30 pm Friday: 8:00 am - 4:30 pm Saturday: Closed Sunday: Closed Missouri S&T Dean of Students Missouri University of Science and Technology 300 W 13th St, 106 Parker Hall, Rolla MO 65409 573-341-4209 dos@mst.edu Missouri University of Science and Technology Missouri S&T, Rolla, MO 65409 800-522-0938 webmaster@mst.edu Work at S&T Accreditation University Police Our Brand S&T Alerts Give to S&T Student Accessibility and Testing Parking Facebook Instagram Linked In Twitter Youtube Discord TikTok All S&T Accounts Missouri S&T is an equal opportunity employer . © The Curators of the University of Missouri UM System Privacy Policy Consumer Information Terminalfour 800-522-0938 web@mst.edu Accessibility Support"
