    "https://career.mst.edu": {
      "title": "Find a Department",
      "description": "career.mst.edu –\r\n    Career Opportunities and Employer Relations |\n    \r\n    Missouri S&T Skip to content Back to S&T Home Apply Visit Inquire Give Campus Map Departments Find a Department View A to Z directory Search Clear No results found. View all departments For You For You Future Students S&T Students Faculty & Staff Alumni Community Family & Friends Tools & Resources Canvas Email Joe'SS My S&T MinerLink myHR Directory News Social Media Events Library Search Explore S&T Missouri S&T Career Opportunities and Employer Relations Schedule an Appointment Career Fair Resources For Students For Alumni For Employers For Faculty and Staff Programs Co-ops Internships About What We Do Staff Directory Statistics and Figures Policies and Procedures career.mst.edu career.mst.edu Career Opportunities and Employer Relations career@mst.edu 573-341-4343 Third Floor Norwood Hall, 320 W. 12th St., Rolla, MO 65409 Career Fair Handshake Schedule an Appointment Next Career Fair September 22, 2026 | Register now Schedule an Appointment Resources About Career Fair Career Closet Speaker's Bureau Request Form Big Interview Left Right config career.mst.edu Left Right Schedule an Appointment Resources About Career Fair Career Closet Speaker's Bureau Request Form Big Interview Left Right Main Content Solving for Tomorrow Career Opportunities and Employer Relations (COER) at Missouri S&T helps students and alumni turn their career goals into reality. Through personalized coaching, hands-on experiences, and direct connections with top employers, COER equips you with the skills and opportunities to thrive in today’s fast-changing world of work. COER has temporarily moved! Please go to the Technology and Development Center : 900 Innovation Dr, Rolla, MO 65401 or request a virtual meeting on Handshake to speak with a COER staff member. 9 # Best Salaries for Graduates Nationally ranked – Wall Street Journal 2025 3 # in Career Placement Nationally ranked - The Princeton Review 5 # in Public School Internships Nationally Ranked - The Princeton Review Let Us Help You Succeed Students Student Resources Browse Resources Employers Employer Resources Browse Resources Alumni Alumni Resources Browse Resources Faculty and Staff Faculty and Staff Resources Browse Resources COER Events The COER Calendar of Events includes details on: professional development seminars, career fair tips and employer engagement opportunities. Check out the Career Office's page on MinerLink to view and subscribe to our full calendar! COER MinerLink Internship & Co-op Wall of Fame Join Us at the Career Fair We Host Career Fairs Every Semester! Tuesday, September 22 | 9:00am-2:00pm Career fairs are held during the fall and spring semesters at Missouri S&T, but employers visit the campus year-round for interviews. View career fair info Career Closet Need Professional Clothing? Approximately 500 students utilize the career closet each year at Missouri S&T.  By supplying students with professional attire, we are giving them a better chance of obtaining a full-time job, co-op or internship. The Career Closet is open Monday-Friday, 8:00am-4:00pm. Learn more Missouri S&T Career Opportunities and Employer Relations Missouri University of Science and Technology 900 Innovation Dr, Rolla, MO 65401 573-341-4343 career@mst.edu Missouri University of Science and Technology Missouri S&T, Rolla, MO 65409 800-522-0938 webmaster@mst.edu Work at S&T Accreditation University Police Our Brand S&T Alerts Giving Student Accessibility and Testing Parking Facebook Instagram All S&T Accounts Missouri S&T is an equal opportunity employer . © The Curators of the University of Missouri UM System Privacy Policy Consumer Information Terminalfour 800-522-0938 web@mst.edu Accessibility Support Missouri S&T - Missouri University of Science and Technology Missouri University of Science and Technology Close Search Search only Yes No Top Searches How to Apply Post Admission Checklist Costs & Fees Academic Dates Scholarships Advising Quick Links Directory Campus Map Current Students Parking S&T Email Giving to S&T Missouri S&T - Missouri University of Science and Technology Missouri University of Science and Technology Apply Visit Inquire Give Close Academics Menu Academics Overview of Academics Search Degrees & Programs Undergraduate Degrees Graduate Degrees Graduate Certificates Online Degrees & Certificates Pre-College Summer Programs Admissions Menu Admissions & Aid Overview of Admissions & Aid First-Time Freshman Transfer Students International Students Graduate Students Online & Distance Military Students Dual Enrollment Summer Camp Students Campus Life Menu Campus Life Overview of Campus Life Living Options Miner Athletics Student Organizations Recreation Design Teams The Rolla Community Research Menu Research Overview of Research Office of Research & Innovation Faculty Experts Research Core Research News Innovation & Entrepreneurship University Libraries For You Future Students S&T Students Faculty & Staff Alumni Community Family & Friends Quick Links Social Events News Campus Map Directory The S&T Store About S&T Overview Rankings Leadership Giving S&T Alerts Work at S&T Facebook Instagram Linked In Twitter Youtube Discord TikTok All S&T Accounts Learn how Missouri S&T is Solving For Tomorrow Missouri S&T 800-522-0938 web@mst.edu Policies Privacy"
