    "https://facultyaffairs.mst.edu/": {
      "title": "Missouri S&TMissouri S&T",
      "description": "facultyaffairs.mst.edu – Faculty Affairs |\n Missouri S&T Skip to content Give News Events Directory Map Select Language ​ ▼ Missouri S&T Missouri S&T Apply Visit Get Info Future Students Current Students Alumni Faculty and Staff All of Missouri S&T Just this site Explore S&T Apply Visit Get Info Future Students Current Students Alumni Faculty and Staff All of Missouri S&T Just this site Give News Events Directory Map facultyaffairs.mst.edu Faculty Affairs 216 Centennial Hall, 300 W 12th St., Rolla, MO 65409 (573) 341-6440 facultyaffairs@mst.edu Faculty Affairs facultyaffairs@mst.edu (573) 341-6440 216 Centennial Hall, 300 W 12th St., Rolla, MO 65409 Home Resources Promotion, Tenure & Beyond Faculty Development Faculty Success Awards Meet The Team Main Content Our Mission Our mission is to provide academic resources, programming, guidance and structures to support our community of scholars along their diverse career paths, from recruitment to retirement. We provide services to faculty that are guided by principles of trust, efficiency, and inclusivity to help them to reach their full potential as teachers, researchers and university leaders. We aspire to create positive experiences throughout all stages of faculty career to develop a sense of belonging to their academic communities. The Office of Faculty Affairs invites you to share actionable suggestions for enhancing S&T. Your anonymous feedback will directly inform campus leadership as we work together to build an environment where faculty members feel supported, recognized, and invested in their future. SUGGESTIONS Our Resources Faculty Resources Faculty Resources Are you looking for policies that govern our university? Or perhaps information about faculty governance or even a funding opportunity? This is the right place to start! Learn More Tenure & Beyond Promotion, Tenure & Beyond Are you a new faculty member or perhaps are you looking for guidelines the tenure and promotion process? You will find here resources to guide you in your promotions and honorific titles as well as your first steps at S&T. Learn More Professional Development Faculty Development Are you looking for opportunities for your professional development? You will have here resources to advance your teaching and research career. Learn More Awards Awards Are you wondering if you qualify for a campus or system award. You will find here the description and application process to apply for awards sponsored by S&T and UM System. Learn More Meet The Team Meet The Team Meet the Faculty Affairs Team. Learn More Follow Faculty Affairs Facebook Twitter Youtube Missouri S&T Faculty Affairs Missouri University of Science and Technology 216 Centennial Hall, 300 W 12th St., Rolla, MO 65409 573-341-6440 facultyaffairs@mst.edu Missouri University of Science and Technology Missouri S&T, Rolla, MO 65409 800-522-0938 webmaster@mst.edu Work at S&T Accreditation University Police Our Brand S&T Alerts Give to S&T Student Accessibility and Testing Parking Facebook Twitter Youtube All S&T Accounts Missouri S&T is an equal opportunity employer . © The Curators of the University of Missouri UM System Privacy Policy Consumer Information Terminalfour 800-522-0938 web@mst.edu Accessibility Support"
